{"strongs": "H5521", "word": "סֻכָּה", "translit": "suk.kah", "root": "סכה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "thicket, booth", "definition": "סֻכָּה noun feminine thicket, booth (properly of inter-woven boughs compare Neh 8:15 ); — absolute ׳ ס Isa 1:8 +; construct סֻכָּת Amos 9:11 suffix סֻכָּתוֺ Job 36:29 ; Ps 18:12 , and so read || 2Sam 22:12 (for ᵑ0 סֻכּוֺת ; De Hup-Now HPS ); usually plural סֻכֹּת Gen 33:17 +; סֻכּוֺת 2Sam 11:11 +; — 1. thicket , lurking-place of lions Job 38:40 (compare [ סֹךְ ] 1. ). 2. booth , rude or temporary shelter, for cattle Gen 33:17 ( J ; distinct from בַּיִת ), but also for warriors in the field 2Sam 11:11 ; 1Kgs 20:12 ; 1Kgs 20:16 for watchers in vineyards Isa 1:8 (simile) Job 27:18 (simile of frailty), for man's shelter from sun Jonah 4:5 , compare (figurative) Isa 4:6 ; Ps 31:21 , probably also Ps 27:5 (see [ סֹךְ ]); in poetry of fallen house (dynasty) of David Amos 9:11 of clouds as (temporary) enclosure ( AV 'pavilion') of ׳ י in storm Ps 18:12 = 2Sam 22:12 ; Job 36:29 . 3. specifically of booths , made of boughs, in which people lived at harvest-feast Lev 23:42 (twice in verse); Lev 23:43 ( H ), Neh 8:14 ; Neh 8:15 ; Neh 8:16 ; Neh 8:17 (twice in verse), hence called חַג הַסֻכּוֺת Deut 16:13 ; Deut 16:16 ; Deut 31:10 ; Lev 23:34 ( P ), Zech 14:16 ; Zech 14:18 ; Zech 14:19 ; 2Chr 8:13 ; Ezra 3:4 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5582')\">BDB5582</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5521')\">H5521</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5581')\">BDB5581</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5583')\">BDB5583</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>סֻכָּה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>thicket, booth</highlightword> (properly of <highlight>inter-woven</highlight> boughs compare <ref ref=\"Neh 8:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,15)\">Neh 8:15</ref>); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,8)\">Isa 1:8</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>סֻכָּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 9:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,11)\">Amos 9:11</ref> suffix <bdbheb>סֻכָּתוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 36:29\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,29)\">Job 36:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 18:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,12)\">Ps 18:12</ref>, and so read || <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,12)\">2Sam 22:12</ref> (for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>סֻכּוֺת</bdbheb>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup-Now</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup>); usually plural <bdbheb>סֻכֹּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 33:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,17)\">Gen 33:17</ref> +; <bdbheb>סֻכּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 11:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,11,11)\">2Sam 11:11</ref> +; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>thicket</highlight>, lurking-place of lions <ref ref=\"Job 38:40\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,40)\">Job 38:40</ref> (compare [<bdbheb>סֹךְ</bdbheb>] </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>booth</highlight>, rude or temporary shelter, for cattle <ref ref=\"Gen 33:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,17)\">Gen 33:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; distinct from <bdbheb>בַּיִת</bdbheb>), but also for warriors in the field <ref ref=\"2Sam 11:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,11,11)\">2Sam 11:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,12)\">1Kgs 20:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:16\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,16)\">1Kgs 20:16</ref> for watchers in vineyards <ref ref=\"Isa 1:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,8)\">Isa 1:8</ref> (simile) <ref ref=\"Job 27:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,18)\">Job 27:18</ref> (simile of frailty), for man's shelter from sun <ref ref=\"Jonah 4:5\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(32,4,5)\">Jonah 4:5</ref>, compare (figurative) <ref ref=\"Isa 4:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,6)\">Isa 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 31:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,21)\">Ps 31:21</ref>, probably also <ref ref=\"Ps 27:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,5)\">Ps 27:5</ref> (see [ <bdbheb><reflink>סֹךְ</reflink></bdbheb>]); in poetry of fallen house (dynasty) of David <ref ref=\"Amos 9:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,11)\">Amos 9:11</ref> of clouds as (temporary) enclosure (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> 'pavilion') of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> in storm <ref ref=\"Ps 18:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,12)\">Ps 18:12</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,12)\">2Sam 22:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 36:29\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,29)\">Job 36:29</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> specifically of <highlight>booths</highlight>, made of boughs, in which people lived at harvest-feast <ref ref=\"Lev 23:42\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,42)\">Lev 23:42</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Lev 23:43\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,43)\">Lev 23:43</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Neh 8:14\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,14)\">Neh 8:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 8:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,15)\">Neh 8:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 8:16\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,16)\">Neh 8:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 8:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,17)\">Neh 8:17</ref> (twice in verse), hence called <bdbheb>חַג הַסֻכּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 16:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,16,13)\">Deut 16:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 16:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,16,16)\">Deut 16:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,10)\">Deut 31:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:34\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,34)\">Lev 23:34</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Zech 14:16\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,16)\">Zech 14:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 14:18\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,18)\">Zech 14:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 14:19\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,19)\">Zech 14:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 8:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,8,13)\"